     "Panchayati Raj",
     "Zila Parishad",
     "tier"
    ],
    "text": {
     "en": "Panchayati Raj has three tiers: Gram Panchayat at village level, Panchayat Samiti at block level and Zila Parishad at district level.\nThe Gram Panchayat is headed by the sarpanch and looks after local roads, water, schools and sanitation. Panchayat Samiti links the villages of a block and the Zila Parishad plans for the district.\nChild-friendly panchayats make sure children's needs are heard. Some sarpanchs have won awards for cleanliness and development."
    }
